    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"The School of Nursing and Midwifery and Department of Nursing Services, Aga Khan University Hospital jointly celebrated the International Nurses Day and International Day of the Midwife on May 21, 2015. This year the theme for IND is 'Nurses: A Force for Change: Care Effective, Cost Effective' whereas for the IDM, it is 'Midwives: for Better Tomorrow'.",
